{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Name","html":"<article id='sn1.61'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.61 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.61 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>7. Addhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>7. Overcome </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Nāmasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Name </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kiṁsu sabbaṁ addhabhavi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“What overcomes everything? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kismā bhiyyo na vijjati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What is it that nothing excels? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kissassu ekadhammassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What is the one thing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbeva vasamanvagū”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that has everything under its sway?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nāmaṁ sabbaṁ addhabhavi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Name overcomes everything. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nāmā bhiyyo na vijjati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nothing excels name. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nāmassa ekadhammassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Name is the one thing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbeva vasamanvagū”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that has everything under its sway.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
